pon you; then you will not be helped.","j":24,"h":47,"s":39,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"39:55","t":"And follow the best of what was revealed to you from your Lord [i.e., the Qur’ān] before the punishment comes upon you suddenly while you do not perceive,","j":24,"h":47,"s":39,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"39:56","t":"Lest a soul should say, \"Oh, [how great is] my regret over what I neglected in regard to Allāh and that I was among the mockers.\"","j":24,"h":47,"s":39,"a":56,"sd":null}],"juz":24,"hizb":47,"surahs":[39],"sajdah":false}